    "narration": {
      "provider": "kokoro",
      "speed": 0.95,
      "text": "Launch day shouldn't mean five dashboards and a spreadsheet. Pulseboard puts every launch in one place. Sign in with your team account, and this week's visitors, live projects and conversion are already waiting. Starting a new launch takes seconds. Give it a name, pick the goal you care about, and hit create. Your new project is live at the top of the board, and tracking starts right away. Then see what's working. One click, and you know which day drove your signups. Track it. Learn from it. Launch again. Pulseboard: launch analytics for small teams. Try it free today."
    },
